---
description: Prefix verbose shell commands with snip to cut token spend
alwaysApply: true
---

When running shell commands that print a lot (`git`, `npm`, `bun`, `eslint`, `tsc`, tests), prefix with snip so Rowe only sees the useful output:

```
snip run -- git status
snip run -- bun run typecheck
```

Skip the prefix for commands that need the full raw stream, or use `snip proxy -- <command>`.
